<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Phase 4 Best in Slot Gear list for Fury Warrior DPS in Wrath of the Lich King Classic. Gear in this guide is primarily obtained from Icecrown Citadel. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from raids, dungeons, PvP, professions, Bind on Equip drops, and reputations.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot">Best in Slot Gear for Fury Warrior DPS in Phase 4</h2>While Fury Warrior has a wide variety of stats it can use, we want to mostly focus on the following priority<ol>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Hit - Aim for 5-8% Hit Rating, depending on how many talent points you have in Precision. An ideal setup uses all 3 points in precision, leaving us with only 5% hit needed on gear, allowing us to focus on stronger secondary stats</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Armor Penetration Rating - With the abundance of ArP Rating available, hard capping ArP (at 1400 rating) is one of our highest priorities.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Strength - Strength is a Fury Warrior's primary stat, and gives 2 base AP per point of Strength. As one of our strongest stats, this will be our primary stat to look for/<wbr/>gem whenever you are unsure of any other stat to pick up.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Expertise - Although our abilities refund rage when avoided, ensuring our casts can't dodge will help our damage quite a lot.</div></li></ol>
