<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="ruby-sanctum">Updates for Best in Slot Gear in Ruby Sanctum</h3>Ruby Sanctum contains several items that we want to include in our setup, due to their high Item level and very generous stat spread. The most powerful of these is the trinket in the form of <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54590/sharpened-twilight-scale">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rubysanctum4.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sharpened Twilight Scale</span></a>, which acts as a direct upgrade to our current BiS, Whispering Fanged Skull. The plate boots give us a massive intake of hit, allowing us to replace our previous hit gems in other slots with either Strength or ArP focused gems instead. Both <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54580/umbrage-armbands">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_41.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Umbrage Armbands</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54581/penumbra-pendant">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_48.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Penumbra Pendant</span></a> act as simple upgrades for our previous slots, although the loss in ArP from <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50733/falinrush-defender-of-quelthalas">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_weapon_crossbow_38.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fal'inrush, Defender of Quel'thalas</span></a> can force some regemming in other places before <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=54590/sharpened-twilight-scale">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rubysanctum4.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sharpened Twilight Scale</span></a> is acquired.<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems">Emblems of Frost for Fury Warrior DPS Phase 4</h3>Emblems of Frost will drop in ICC and VoA as well as being a reward for the Daily Heroic. The primary use of Emblems is to buy the new tier set, which can only be obtained either through badges, or from a random drop in VoA. While chest and helm are the superior slots to buy first, shoulders are also acceptable; Legs should always be bought last, as they can drop from the new VoA boss, as well as having a large amount of expertise which may be difficult to use early, considering the amount of expertise gear we equipped last phase.<br/>
<br/>
